     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«に違いない» expresses a firm conclusion; «とは限らない» warns that something isn't always true.",
     "texto": [
      "The two constructions look at the evidence differently: one reinforces a deduction; the other limits a generalization.",
      "へや が くらくて、 でんき も ついて いません。 だれも いない に ちがいありません。 (The room is dark and no lights are on. Surely there's nobody there.)",
